{"data": [{"author_id": "2047489959184187392", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:51:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120318458177163667"], "id": "2120318458177163667", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这不是那个网站吗… 还有收费的 哈哈哈", "url": "https://x.com/ai_super_niko/status/2120318458177163667"}, {"author_id": "2018514111538335744", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:31:59.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120313553161003421"], "id": "2120313553161003421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 老师，订阅RSS样式改一下 https://t.co/AGssSqMuG7", "url": "https://x.com/DashuaiY66/status/2120313553161003421"}, {"author_id": "1832017075273105408", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-11T00:10:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120308240877752418"], "id": "2120308240877752418", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 38, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 看到该网址的都是能直接看X的 😂", "url": "https://x.com/mfive321/status/2120308240877752418"}, {"author_id": "2096844259391651840", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:58:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120305237294539004"], "id": "2120305237294539004", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 好文章隔着海也不耽误下饭。能搬过来给更多人看，这事值当。", "url": "https://x.com/Felix0532/status/2120305237294539004"}, {"author_id": "1718392479911735296", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T23:22:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120295968163979384"], "id": "2120295968163979384", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 How do you handle an author editing the original after the Chinese version is published? A visible source link and a last-checked date would make a daily digest much easier to trust.", "url": "https://x.com/liu_zhuo86823/status/2120295968163979384"}, {"author_id": "2068767915285909504", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T19:14:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120233673236652409"], "id": "2120233673236652409", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这个方向很实用，尤其是盯住一批研究员和模型公司的链接，信息密度会比刷时间线高很多。开源出来还能改成自己的信源，关键是转写别写成翻译腔，真正把长文里的判断留下来。", "url": "https://x.com/bhhb8668/status/2120233673236652409"}, {"author_id": "566170921", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:44:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120226016010420463"], "id": "2120226016010420463", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 191, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 抓取 X 文章，这个还真的只能是 Grok 这种自家产品才能抓的到https://t.co/QEB2AABtxn", "url": "https://x.com/realYanming/status/2120226016010420463"}, {"author_id": "805608407294017536", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T18:33:45.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120223401843491196"], "id": "2120223401843491196", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 这个思路很实在，盯研究员和模型公司官方账号那一下就值了，海外长文很多都是第一手消息，等中文圈搬运过来已经慢半拍了。转写成网站也聪明，沉淀下来能反复查，比只在时间线刷过强多了。我回头也按自己的关注列表改一版试试。", "url": "https://x.com/MrLin728/status/2120223401843491196"}, {"author_id": "2020255388952850432", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:06:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120201322670792806"], "id": "2120201322670792806", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 开源的价值是让人抄『监控第一梯队』的活。真正的成本在精选层：筛选、转写、校对，这些做不满自动化的地方，才是质量来源。一人类+一 bot 盯 N 个信源，就是一人公司的最优配置。", "url": "https://x.com/kuailewenhao/status/2120201322670792806"}, {"author_id": "2094912187751899137", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T17:00:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120200035162058889"], "id": "2120200035162058889", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 31, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 马上安装试试看", "url": "https://x.com/CY160909/status/2120200035162058889"}, {"author_id": "1949157978558664704", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:57:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120199245710172363"], "id": "2120199245710172363", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 想要一个“今天比昨天新增了什么”的视图。同一个发布好几位作者都在聊时，合在一起看各自补充了什么，比每天再读一遍相似介绍更省时间。", "url": "https://x.com/Talljackcv/status/2120199245710172363"}, {"author_id": "14202679", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T16:35:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120193568912662818"], "id": "2120193568912662818", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@vista8 我倒是做了一个 X 长文汇集站，也支持文章翻译\nhttps://t.co/KiClmGqrn6", "url": "https://x.com/zachzhao1984/status/2120193568912662818"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "conversation_id": "2120099636149153857", "created_at": "2026-11-10T15:46:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120181286450950467"], "id": "2120181286450950467", "public_metrics": 